OL,3,GNEWSAStudy shows 'economic and social  
OL,4,Avalue' of concerts                     
OL,6,FDougie Scarfe, the BSO's chief         
OL,7,Fexecutive, said the orchestra put its  
OL,8,Fregion and its communities "at the     
OL,9,Fheart of everything it does".          
